# Optional: where the big Stockfish 19 NNUE .wasm files are served from.
# Leave empty to self-host them from /engine (copied there on npm install).
# Cloudflare Pages caps files at 25 MiB, so on Pages point this at an R2 bucket
# or other CDN that serves the files with CORS + "Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: cross-origin".
# Example: VITE_ENGINE_WASM_BASE=https://engine.example.com/stockfish/
VITE_ENGINE_WASM_BASE=
